{
  "Name": "InduSoft Web Studio ISSymbol.ocx InternationalSeparator() Heap Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a heap overflow found in InduSoft Web Studio <= 61.6.00.00 SP6. The overflow exists in the ISSymbol.ocx, and can be triggered with a long string argument for the InternationalSeparator() method of the ISSymbol control. This module uses the msvcr71.dll form the Java JRE6 to bypass ASLR.",
